WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:02.630
…embracing who I am.

2
00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:07.987
She’s gonna kill me, but my yoga mentor’s in the audience.

3
00:00:08.007 --> 00:00:11.160
Tammy from Yoga Nrg, everyone, over here.

4
00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:16.482
So I learned my mindfulness and yoga training from Tammy,

5
00:00:16.502 --> 00:00:20.730
and one of the beautiful things about mindfulness is acceptance.

6
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:22.612
Acceptance.

7
00:00:22.632 --> 00:00:25.270
Acceptance for all of you.

8
00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:27.951
So instead of trying to squash this little bit here

9
00:00:27.971 --> 00:00:30.460
that you don’t like, and you kick it and try and

10
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:32.554
boot it out the door, accepting,

11
00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:34.360
getting the heart bigger,

12
00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.510
and accepting all of it.

13
00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:39.900
And that’s what I’ve been on a journey to do,

14
00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:42.025
and I’ve had an amazing team of different people

15
00:00:42.045 --> 00:00:43.700
that have helped me in doing that.
